13. Real Production Challenges

| Problem                      | Solution                 |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------ |
| Huge DB size                 | Incremental backup       |
| Backup affecting performance | Replica-based backup     |
| Storage cost                 | Compression + lifecycle  |
| Backup corruption            | Checksum validation      |
| Ransomware                   | Immutable backups        |
| Region failure               | Cross-region replication |


